    "status": "ok",
    "text": "October 13, 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers Exchange Plaza, Plot No. C-1, Block G Dalal Street Mumbai – 400 001 Scrip Code: 500408 Bandra – Kurla Complex Bandra (East) Mumbai – 400 051 NSE Symbol: TATAELXSI Dear Sirs/Madam, Sub: Allotment of equity shares This is to inform that the Board of Directors of the Company has allotted 686 equity shares on October 13, 2026, pursuant to the exercise of performance stock options by the eligible employees, under ‘Tata Elxsi Limited Performance Stock Option Plan 2023’. Consequent to this allotment, the paid-up equity share Capital of the Company stands increased to Rs. 62,30,64,170 divided into 6,23,06,417 equity shares of Rs. 10/- each from Rs. 62,30,57,310 divided into 6,23,05,731 equity shares of Rs. 10/- each. You are requested to please take the same on record. The aforesaid disclosure is also available on the Company’s website at www.tataelxsi.com. Yours faithfully, For Tata Elxsi Limited Sneha V Company Secretary & Compliance Officer"
